---
title: Component Interaction Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Header as Header Nav
    participant Select as engine-select.ts
    participant Engine as babylon-scene (default)<br/>or space-engine (?engine=webgl)
    participant Scene as SpaceScene (React)
    participant Overlay as SectionOverlay / CollectorCard

    Note over Select: URL param -> stored override -> default ("babylon")<br/>ADR-0006 cutover, 2026-07-19

    Scene->>Select: resolveEngine(urlParam, stored)
    Select->>Scene: "babylon" | "webgl"
    Scene->>Engine: dynamic import + mount matching custom element
    Note over Engine: 168,959 real Hipparcos/Gaia/SDSS objects<br/>decoded from PNG-packed catalog

    User->>Header: Click "About"
    Header->>Scene: document-level click delegation
    Scene->>Engine: travelTo("st-about")
    Engine->>Scene: dispatchEvent("cosmos:select", {id})
    Engine->>Scene: dispatchEvent("cosmos:warp", {id, t, phase, ly, vC})
    Note over Engine: Aim + warp animation<br/>(fixed short durations if prefers-reduced-motion)
    Engine->>Scene: dispatchEvent("cosmos:arrive", {id})
    Scene->>Overlay: open dossier for arrived section

    User->>Overlay: Click close / Press Escape
    Overlay->>Scene: onClose()
    Scene->>Overlay: unmount dossier

    rect rgb(26,35,46)
        Note over Engine: Legacy-only events (archived engine)
        Note right of Engine: cosmos:aim, cosmos:hover,<br/>cosmos:unhover, cosmos:craft<br/>are NOT emitted by babylon-scene<br/>— see the cutover gap analysis
    end

    rect rgb(26,35,46)
        Note over Engine: Backend fallback ladder (Babylon path)
        Engine->>Engine: probe navigator.gpu.requestAdapter()
        Engine->>Engine: null -> silent WebGL2 fallback
        Note right of Engine: probe FIRST: initAsync on an adapterless<br/>browser logs a console ERROR (TR-053)
    end

    rect rgb(26,35,46)
        Note over Engine: No-WebGL Fallback
        Engine->>Engine: context creation fails
        Engine->>Engine: static CSS sky fallback
        Engine->>Scene: dispatchEvent("cosmos:ready")
        Note over Scene: Navigation still works via<br/>the noGL branch of travelTo/goHome
    end
